    "Systematic enumeration of label-versus-destination mismatches across (1) navConfig rail leaves, (2) brief/signals action_label vs action_href (Attention on /brief and Overview hub), (3) hub Workflows PanelRow hrefs, (4) headline-figure click targets. Record every instance in implementer evidence. Origin: 2026-09-13 discovery on this branch (D-0010 rail vs tabs plus live brief signals). Do not limit the node to named cases.",
